    "The release date can differ from the filing date: ASMB 2026-08-14 (release 2026-08-13), PARR 2026-08-05 (release 2026-08-04) and SLSN 2026-08-20 (release 2026-08-19). The event is the release, not the filing.",
    "Corporate actions to check at attestation include JBSS's special dividend; the owner attests them per batch.",
    "The nine other 8-Ks within three days of a candidate stay unread: SLSN Item 4.02 (2026-08-21), KLC Item 1.01 (2026-08-14), ASMB Item 2.01 (the mis-tagged original, whose content the 8-K/A says is unchanged), ACHV Item 8.01, HURN Item 5.02, NBIX 8-K/A, and three Item 5.07 results. Reading any of them needs a separate permission."
